                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1117D00                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  THIS PROGRAM CHECKS THE LATEST STOCK BALANCE STATUS   *        
*                AS IS REFLECTED IN VIPS FILE W11645.  IF FLERSATT=N,  *        
*                THEN THERE IS STILL STOCK AT SOME DC IN EUROPE.       *        
*                IF THERE IS STOCK IN EU, THEN THE SUPERSESSION INFO   *        
*                (FILE W11170) IS NOT SENT TO VR, BUT IS INSTEAD       *        
*                WRITTEN TO FILE W1117D INSTEAD. IN THE NEXT RUN(S),   *        
*                EACH PENDING SUPERSESSION IN W1117D IS RE-EVALUATED   *        
*                AGAIN TO SEE IF THE STOCK HAS BEEN USED UP YET.       *        
*                IF SO, THEN THE PENDING DATA IS SENT AS-IS TO VR,     *        
*                EXCEPT THAT TIAAMMDD IS SET TO TODAY'S DATE.          *        
*                                                                      *        
*                NOTE THAT IF "FRESH" SUPERSESSION DATA IS IN W11170,  *        
*                THEN THE PENDING DATA IN W1117D WILL BE SKIPPED SO    *        
*                THAT ONLY THE FRESH DATA IS CONSIDERED.               *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  CHESTER COUCH                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  JUNE 2025                                             *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W1117DD1                                                                   
%W111702A  (IN70-)                                                              
*                                                                               
FILE W1117DD2                                                                   
%W111702A  (IN7D-)                                                              
*                                                                               
FILE TEMP70A VIRTUAL VB(157 0)                                                  
%W111702A  (TMP70A-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE TEMP70 VIRTUAL VB(157 0)                                                   
%W111702A  (TMP70-)                                                             
%W111701A  (TMP701-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W1117DD3                                                                   
%W11645    (IN45-)                                                              
*                                                                               
FILE W1117DD4 VB (157 0)                                                        
%W111702A  (UT7D-)                                                              
*                                                                               
FILE W1117DD5 VB (157 0)                                                        
%W111702A  (UT70-)                                                              
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
WS-KDERS-NEW              W  2 P  0                                             
                                                                                
WS-DATE                   W  8 A                                                
WS-DATE-YY WS-DATE           2 A                                                
WS-DATE-MM WS-DATE +3        2 A                                                
WS-DATE-DD WS-DATE +6        2 A                                                
                                                                                
WS-YYMMDD                 W  6 N                                                
WS-YYMMDD-YY WS-YYMMDD       2 A                                                
WS-YYMMDD-MM WS-YYMMDD +2    2 A                                                
WS-YYMMDD-DD WS-YYMMDD +4    2 A                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* 1: SKIP PENDING RECORDS FOR PARTS THAT HAVE NEW INFO IN W11170                
*    INPUT : FILES W1117D AND W11170                                            
*    OUTPUT: TEMP70                                                             
JOB INPUT (W1117DD1 KEY(IN70-IDARTNR-ERS)    +                                  
           W1117DD2 KEY(IN7D-IDARTNR-ERS))                                      
                                                                                
IF NOT MATCHED AND W1117DD2                                                     
      TMP70A-W111702A   = IN7D-W111702A                                         
      PUT TEMP70A                                                               
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* 2: APPEND ALL RECORDS IN W11170 TO TEMP70                                     
*    INPUT : FILES W11170    AND TEMP70A                                        
*    OUTPUT: COPY ALL RECORDS TO TEMP70                                         
JOB INPUT (W1117DD1 KEY(IN70-IDARTNR-ERS)    +                                  
           TEMP70A  KEY(TMP70A-IDARTNR-ERS))                                    
IF W1117DD1                                                                     
      TMP70-W111702A   = IN70-W111702A                                          
      PUT TEMP70                                                                
ELSE                                                                            
      TMP70-W111702A   = TMP70A-W111702A                                        
      PUT TEMP70                                                                
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* 3: SORT TEMP70 BY PART, RECORD TYPE AND SEQUENCE NUMBER                       
*    INPUT : TEMP70                                                             
*    OUTPUT: TEMP70                                                             
SORT TEMP70  TO TEMP70                                     +                    
        USING (TMP70-IDARTNR-ERS, TMP70-IDPTYP, TMP70-IDLOPNR)                  
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* 4: MATCH W11645 AND TEMP70. IF FLERSATT='N', WRITE TEMP70                     
*    IF MATCHED AND THERE'S STILL STOCK (FLERSATT='N') AND                      
*    THE SUPERSESSION IS NOT BEING BACKED OUT (KDERS-NEW=0)                     
*      WRITE TEMP70-RECORDS TO UT7D-PENDING-FILE.                               
*    OTHERWISE,                                                                 
*      WRITE TEMP70-RECORDS TO UT70-FILE TO SEND TO VR.                         
*    INPUT : FILES W11645 AND TEMP70                                            
*    OUTPUT: TEMP70                                                             
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W1117DD3 KEY(IN45-IDARTNR)       +                                   
           TEMP70   KEY(TMP70-IDARTNR-ERS)) +                                   
     START A-INIT                                                               
                                                                                
IF TEMP70 AND TMP70-IDPTYP = '701'                                              
   WS-KDERS-NEW        = TMP701-KDERS-NEW                                       
END-IF                                                                          
IF MATCHED                                                                      
   IF   IN45-FLERSATT = 'N'                  +                                  
   AND (WS-KDERS-NEW EQ 21, 24, 29)                                             
      UT7D-W111702A    = TMP70-W111702A                                         
      PUT W1117DD4                                                              
   ELSE                                                                         
      UT70-W111702A    = TMP70-W111702A                                         
      UT70-TIAAMMDD    = WS-YYMMDD                                              
      IF UT70-IDPTYP = '701'                                                    
        RECORD-LENGTH(W1117DD5) = 152                                           
      ELSE                                                                      
*                      '702'                                                    
        RECORD-LENGTH(W1117DD5) = 153                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
      PUT W1117DD5                                                              
   END-IF                                                                       
ELSE                                                                            
   IF TEMP70                                                                    
      IF WS-KDERS-NEW EQ 21, 24, 29                                             
*         HAVE TO WAIT 1 DAY AT LEAST TO GET THE EUROPE STOCK                   
*         BALANCE STATUS FROM A NEW W11645-FILE FROM ROUTINE W116D3             
         UT7D-W111702A    = TMP70-W111702A                                      
         PUT W1117DD4                                                           
      ELSE                                                                      
         UT70-W111702A    = TMP70-W111702A                                      
         UT70-TIAAMMDD    = WS-YYMMDD                                           
         IF UT70-IDPTYP = '701'                                                 
           RECORD-LENGTH(W1117DD5) = 152                                        
         ELSE                                                                   
*                         '702'                                                 
           RECORD-LENGTH(W1117DD5) = 153                                        
         END-IF                                                                 
         PUT W1117DD5                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  WS-DATE     = SYSDATE                                                         
                                                                                
  WS-YYMMDD-YY  = WS-DATE-YY                                                    
  WS-YYMMDD-MM  = WS-DATE-MM                                                    
  WS-YYMMDD-DD  = WS-DATE-DD                                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
